			"notes": "- complete rework of the config file (/config), changed type from common to client\n- added the option to enable/disable notifications\n- added the option to enable/disable debug mode\n- added the option to receive notifications when loading the world (current month)\n- added text localization based on game settings with the option to set custom messages\n- added en_us, ru_ru, cs_cz localizations\n- added option to set text color\n- added option to adjust notification duration\n- added option to adjust settings for individual months separately (enable/disable, colors with the option to inherit from default, custom messages)\n- fixed several minor bugs that could cause notifications not to be displayed"
